IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `er3-nouns`
IMPORT `er3-division`

-- Tests of er3-division (regulation 41.6). Every expected value is written by hand from the text of reg 41.6
-- (SOR-96-332.txt lines 740-743): the weeks go round the claimants in the order in which they made their claims.
-- The inputs are: cannot agree, a division fixed by 76.21(2) or 76.42(2), weeks, claimants, place.

-- (a) weeks equal claimants: one each.
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 3 3 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 3 3 3 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 2 2 2 EQUALS JUST 1
-- (b) more weeks than claimants: 7 weeks, 3 claimants: 3, 2, 2 (the first claimant gets the extra week).
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 7 3 1 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 7 3 2 EQUALS JUST 2
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 7 3 3 EQUALS JUST 2
-- 8 weeks, 3 claimants: 3, 3, 2.
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 8 3 1 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 8 3 2 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 8 3 3 EQUALS JUST 2
-- 9 weeks, 3 claimants: 3 each. 5 weeks, 2 claimants: 3 and 2.
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 9 3 3 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 5 2 1 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 5 2 2 EQUALS JUST 2
-- (c) fewer weeks than claimants: 2 weeks, 3 claimants: the first two claimants get a week each, the third none.
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 2 3 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 2 3 2 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 2 3 3 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 1 2 1 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 1 2 2 EQUALS JUST 0
-- not covered: the claimants agree; a division is fixed by 76.21(2) or 76.42(2); no such claimant.
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` FALSE FALSE 7 3 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE TRUE 7 3 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 7 3 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 7 3 4 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 41.6 the weeks of benefits paid to the claimant` TRUE FALSE 7 0 1 EQUALS NOTHING
